DISCLAIMER

This skill rewrites prose so that it can be understood by ear. Applied to legal
material it changes sentence structure, ordering, and emphasis, and it removes
citation apparatus that a reader would rely on.

Audio produced by this skill is not legal advice and is not a substitute for the
document it was made from. Quoted authority is reproduced exactly or is openly
marked as paraphrase, but a listening version of a brief, opinion, statute, or
contract remains a derivative rendering. Where the exact words govern — an
operative contract term, a statutory provision, a holding to be relied upon — read
the source.
